# AI LINE Bot System — MVP Proposal

> **LINE-based workflow & task management platform with AI assistance**
> Designed for multi-store operations · Built on Supabase · Powered by Qwen 3.5

---

## The Problem

Multi-store retail operations rely on spreadsheets, scattered LINE messages, and manual follow-ups to manage store openings, procurement, and daily tasks. This leads to:

- **No single source of truth** — task status lives in spreadsheets, hard to track in real-time
- **No accountability** — assignments and deadlines aren't enforced
- **Manual reminders** — managers chase updates instead of getting auto-alerts
- **No visibility** — leadership can't see operational progress across stores at a glance

---

## The Solution

A **LINE-native workflow platform** where teams manage tasks, track progress, and receive AI-powered assistance — all from the messaging app they already use daily.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│               LINE Chat / Groups            │
│   Commands: /任務 列表  ·  /流程 狀態       │
└──────────────────┬──────────────────────────┘
                   │ webhook
┌──────────────────▼──────────────────────────┐
│            Supabase Backend                 │
│  Edge Functions · PostgreSQL · Auth · Cron  │
├─────────────────────────────┬───────────────┤
│     Workflow & Task Engine  │  AI Engine    │
│     Notification Engine     │  (Qwen 3.5)  │
│     Trigger Engine          │              │
└─────────────────────────────┴───────────────┘
                   │
┌──────────────────▼──────────────────────────┐
│         Admin Dashboard (React)             │
│  Workflows · Tasks · Triggers · LINE Mgmt  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

