## MVP Scope — 6 Phases

### Phase 1 · Foundation
Core database, LINE Bot webhook, Qwen 3.5 AI chat, admin UI skeleton, user authentication.

### Phase 2 · Task & Workflow Management
Workflow engine (templates → instances → steps), task CRUD, assignment, status tracking, admin task board.

### Phase 3 · LINE Commands (Bilingual)
Teams interact via LINE in **Traditional Chinese or English**:

| 中文指令 | English | 動作 |
|---|---|---|
| `/任務 列表` | `/task list` | 查看我的任務 |
| `/任務 新增 [標題]` | `/task create` | 建立新任務 |
| `/任務 [id] 完成` | `/task done` | 完成任務 |
| `/流程 狀態` | `/workflow status` | 查看流程進度 |
| `/指派 [id] [人員]` | `/assign` | 指派任務 |
| `/提醒 [id] [時間]` | `/remind` | 設定提醒 |
| `/報告` | `/report` | 每日摘要 |

### Phase 4 · Auto Reminders & Notifications
Scheduled reminders, overdue escalation, LINE push notifications, centralized notification rules.

### Phase 5 · Workflow Triggers
Event-driven automation: "When task X completes → create task Y → notify manager." Admin UI for trigger setup.

### Phase 6 · LINE Identity & Group Mapping
Map LINE users → internal users, LINE groups → departments/stores, group-based notification routing.

